<title>HONG KONG: Universal App in 103 mln new shrs issue.</title>
<headline>Universal App in 103 mln new shrs issue.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Universal Appliances Ltd said on Friday it would be required to issue 102.94 million new shares, or 6.57 percent of the enlarged share capital, to satisfy the conversion of a convertible loan stock.</p>
<p>The electronic products maker said holder Yang Seung Chun had exercised his right to convert the entire HK$35 million convertible loan stock due on June 30, 1997 into company shares at HK$0.34 each.</p>
<p>The company said Yang did not hold any shares prior to the conversion. It gave no details about Yang.</p>
<p>Universal Appliance shares fell HK$0.005 to HK$0.420 in early Friday morning trade.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
